  "referenceNumber": "RUS2001",
  "remarks": "\nMarina Aleksandrovna Mordashova is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the following ground: Marina Mordashova is associated with a person who is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from the Government of Russia, namely Alexey Alexandrovich MORDASHOV.\n",
